flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Initialize MOO optimization"]
BufferCapacityProblemNode["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes n_var 6<br/>xl xu arrays with ranges {1-10}<br/>n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>Method _evaluate batch evaluate population"]
NSGA2Node["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Setup sampling crossover mutation<br/>Runs minimize with problem and termination"]
OptimizationLoop["**Optimization Loop**<br/>Iterate generations and evolve population<br/>Call problem _evaluate each generation"]
MultiprocessingNode["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Processes 50<br/>Maps evaluate single individual across population"]
EvaluateNode["**EvaluateSingleIndividual**<br/>Inputs caps seed replications<br/>Runs n replications of simulation<br/>Returns objectives wip minimized and throughput maximized negated for minimizer"]
SimulationNode["**RunSimulationOptimized**<br/>Decision variables caps six integers {1-10}<br/>Construct simulation scenario with buffers and machines<br/>Produces metrics throughput wip produced_parts machine_energy"]
DelayBufferNode["**DelayBuffer**<br/>Attributes capacity delay cap tokens in transit<br/>Methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
MachineNode["**Machine**<br/>Attributes name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power defect_rate capacity<br/>Methods run waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption reset_machine_stats"]
AggregationNode["**Evaluation Aggregation**<br/>Aggregate replication outputs<br/>Compute average throughput and average wip<br/>Return objective vector for individual"]
SetFNode["**Set Objective Matrix**<br/>BufferCapacityProblem sets out F for the evaluated population<br/>Used by NSGA2 for selection"]
HistoryNode["**Result History**<br/>Save population and objective history each generation<br/>Includes decision variables and KPI values"]
ExporterNode["**Exporter CSV**<br/>Write generation individual decision variables wip throughput to CSV in results folder"]
End["**End**<br/>Optimization complete and results exported"]

Start --> BufferCapacityProblemNode
BufferCapacityProblemNode --> NSGA2Node
NSGA2Node --> OptimizationLoop
OptimizationLoop --> MultiprocessingNode
MultiprocessingNode --> EvaluateNode
EvaluateNode --> SimulationNode
SimulationNode --> DelayBufferNode
SimulationNode --> MachineNode
SimulationNode --> AggregationNode
AggregationNode --> EvaluateNode
EvaluateNode --> MultiprocessingNode
MultiprocessingNode --> SetFNode
SetFNode --> NSGA2Node
NSGA2Node --> HistoryNode
HistoryNode --> ExporterNode
ExporterNode --> End